      ],
      "rationale": "`JackGraphWindowConfigMutation` is the config state lane of `s.trinity.jack`'s ✏️editor/🎭️modes/✏️edit/🪟️windows/🌐️graph/🎚️config surface: it holds one jack graph window's camera and LOD mode. This is this repository's own editor state record, not a published format, so no third party implements it. What is under test is that each kind (`set-camera`, `set-lod-mode`) changes exactly its own part of `JackGraphWindowConfig`, and that every kind's computed inverse, read off the pre-mutation record, restores it exactly. Confidence comes from one committed, handcrafted (before, mutation, after, diff, outcome) vector per kind and declared outcome class under `../🧫️fixtures/`, exercised end to end through the production dispatch bridge, and from the inverse law as a metamorphic property.",
      "substitutes": [
        "specification-vectors",
        "metamorphic-laws"
      ],
